WEBVTT

00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:01.980
What are you laughing at?

00:00:01.980 --> 00:00:02.060
Son of a lowborn cur!
What are you laughing at?

00:00:02.060 --> 00:00:03.820
Son of a lowborn cur!

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:12.730
I've been happy. Sion, it's because I had you.

00:00:13.190 --> 00:00:19.360
You've grown into a sweet child. That alone makes me proud.

00:00:25.980 --> 00:00:29.250
What's with that look? You dare to defy us?

00:00:29.490 --> 00:00:31.130
Lowly cur!

00:00:31.130 --> 00:00:35.630
<i>It doesn't matter who speaks poorly of you,</i>

00:00:35.630 --> 00:00:41.770
<i>because you'll find plenty of people who will love you</i>

00:00:41.770 --> 00:00:46.160
<i>So even if I'm not there, you're...</i>

00:00:47.820 --> 00:00:51.110
<i>You're not alone.</i>

00:00:52.520 --> 00:00:55.610
<i>At least understand that.</i>

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:35.920
I have a lead.

00:02:35.920 --> 00:02:38.180
You mean... him?

00:02:38.180 --> 00:02:42.260
He still has yet to show up for practice sessions.

00:02:42.260 --> 00:02:44.860
I'd like to see what he can do for once.

00:02:45.780 --> 00:02:47.300
I understand, but he's...

00:02:47.300 --> 00:02:50.410
Roll, I'll decide in two days.

00:02:51.260 --> 00:02:53.120
Where are you going?

00:02:53.740 --> 00:02:56.500
Researching. The usual place.

00:03:03.440 --> 00:03:09.010
<i>It's a place that raises weapons of war to keep nobles off the front lines.</i>

00:03:09.540 --> 00:03:12.260
<i>Even children of lowly curs, like me...</i>

00:03:19.990 --> 00:03:22.800
<i>He left Germer Kleisrole Training Institute</i>

00:03:22.800 --> 00:03:26.050
<i>for Roland Special Institute #307.</i>

00:03:26.050 --> 00:03:27.810
<i>The Black-haired Devil.</i>

00:03:31.640 --> 00:03:32.830
Who's there?

00:03:34.920 --> 00:03:38.290
What a bad nap. I'm so tired.

00:03:38.290 --> 00:03:41.980
I woke up too early, and now my head hurts.

00:03:43.080 --> 00:03:46.800
Have you been sleeping in here the entire time? This is a library.

00:03:46.800 --> 00:03:48.560
I know.

00:03:48.560 --> 00:03:50.410
This place is closed now.

00:03:50.410 --> 00:03:55.740
Oh, okay. See you in the morning. Night.

00:03:55.740 --> 00:03:57.930
That's not what I meant.

00:04:01.130 --> 00:04:07.990
Roland's most powerful magician. The Black-haired Devil, Ryner Lute.

00:04:08.770 --> 00:04:09.950
Couldn't be.

00:04:18.500 --> 00:04:19.950
It's Sion!

00:04:19.950 --> 00:04:21.500
That's a rare sight.

00:04:29.330 --> 00:04:33.220
What was that? You finally show up for practice...

00:04:33.220 --> 00:04:37.230
...and it doesn't amount to anything, Ryner Lute.

00:04:37.230 --> 00:04:39.490
<i>That's</i> Ryner Lute?

00:04:41.140 --> 00:04:45.650
Come on, Ryner. Why are you always so unmotivated?

00:04:45.650 --> 00:04:49.650
There's no person who twitches so obviously, and then stays collapsed!

00:04:49.650 --> 00:04:50.820
You're looking at one.

00:04:50.820 --> 00:04:52.210
Back to practice.

00:04:52.210 --> 00:04:55.020
I'm using my next spell. Ready?

00:04:55.020 --> 00:04:55.930
Nope.

00:04:55.930 --> 00:04:57.620
Don't give me "nope"!

00:04:58.080 --> 00:05:00.460
What I seek is thunder. Izuchi!

00:05:00.460 --> 00:05:02.330
With magic this simple...

00:05:05.950 --> 00:05:11.170
Goodness, why didn't you avoid it? You're okay, right? Right?

00:05:11.480 --> 00:05:13.760
Quit it with the jokes! Ryner!

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:18.140
No response. It seems to be a corpse.

00:05:21.700 --> 00:05:23.310
I'm tired today.

00:05:23.650 --> 00:05:25.640
You're always tired!

00:05:25.640 --> 00:05:29.410
What a troublemaker. Ryner, shame of the academy.

00:05:29.410 --> 00:05:32.820
Just being around him would lower even our own standing.

00:05:34.040 --> 00:05:35.470
I'm tired today, too.

00:05:35.470 --> 00:05:38.040
Don't correct yourself, jeez.

00:05:38.690 --> 00:05:41.790
I'm not letting you slack off today, okay?

00:05:41.790 --> 00:05:45.850
If you don't train today, your grades will be in danger.

00:05:45.850 --> 00:05:48.400
You don't want to be held back while we all get promoted, right?

00:05:48.400 --> 00:05:49.860
You're a pest, Ryner!

00:05:49.860 --> 00:05:52.490
Weaklings should stay home!

00:05:52.490 --> 00:05:54.890
Could you all cut that out?

00:05:59.560 --> 00:06:02.520
<i>That last direct hit. I saw him.</i>

00:06:04.920 --> 00:06:06.620
Who's Mr. Silver-hair?

00:06:06.620 --> 00:06:09.140
Sion Astal. He's a noble...

00:06:09.140 --> 00:06:11.020
Ah... Never heard of him.

00:06:11.020 --> 00:06:13.180
You're Kiefer Knolles, yes?

00:06:13.180 --> 00:06:14.500
I am. How did you know my name?
You're Kiefer Knolles, yes?

00:06:14.500 --> 00:06:16.900
I am. How did you know my name?

00:06:16.900 --> 00:06:20.650
I try to remember the names of excellent students.

00:06:20.650 --> 00:06:22.760
Me, really?

00:06:22.760 --> 00:06:25.910
You've gotten above-average grades in every course.

00:06:25.910 --> 00:06:28.770
Plus, you're cheerful, attractive, and popular.

00:06:28.770 --> 00:06:30.550
Attractive, oh my!

00:06:30.550 --> 00:06:31.840
You're going overboard.

00:06:33.740 --> 00:06:35.590
I have a proposal.

00:06:36.020 --> 00:06:39.460
Kiefer, would you like to join my team?

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:40.100
Your team?

00:06:40.860 --> 00:06:44.600
We'll be forming groups for mock battle training soon.

00:06:44.600 --> 00:06:49.430
If we were to be on the same team, it could have advantages.

00:06:49.430 --> 00:06:50.590
But...

00:06:50.590 --> 00:06:53.510
What's the problem? Just do it.

00:06:53.510 --> 00:06:55.610
Then I can't have my afternoon naps...

00:06:55.610 --> 00:06:58.460
No, I want you too, Ryner.

00:06:59.760 --> 00:07:01.630
Sounds like a pain to me.

00:07:01.630 --> 00:07:05.790
How so? With Sion with you, you're sure to be promoted!

00:07:05.790 --> 00:07:11.290
So what? Why invite me, anyway? He knows my grades.

00:07:11.290 --> 00:07:14.940
It's clear he wants you, not me.

00:07:14.940 --> 00:07:18.600
Dummy. If you say that, we'll get separated...

00:07:18.600 --> 00:07:23.690
Look, Ryner. I really want you on my team.

00:07:24.450 --> 00:07:25.480
Why?

00:07:25.480 --> 00:07:29.600
If I have to state a reason, it's because I like your eyes.

00:07:29.600 --> 00:07:30.940
Wha...?

00:07:32.630 --> 00:07:35.970
With a reason like that? No way.

00:07:35.970 --> 00:07:40.450
Phew, I'm beat after a long day of real practice. Later.

00:07:43.270 --> 00:07:46.260
Don't grumble so much. I told you, I like your eyes.

00:07:46.260 --> 00:07:51.840
I want you, the bearer of the Alpha Stigma.

00:07:53.080 --> 00:07:55.500
I don't know what you're talking about.

00:07:55.500 --> 00:08:00.660
Don't be so modest. I looked up your past.

00:08:00.660 --> 00:08:04.750
I'm out of here. Working under others isn't my style.

00:08:04.750 --> 00:08:09.020
If you don't join me, I'll expose you. To everyone.

00:08:10.170 --> 00:08:12.020
Alpha Stigma bearer.

00:08:13.330 --> 00:08:14.940
Ryner Lute.

00:08:16.910 --> 00:08:20.770
You're really having that monster join you?

00:08:20.770 --> 00:08:24.950
Whether he can control those eyes is a different issue, though.

00:08:24.950 --> 00:08:30.670
Do take care. Here are the war games documents.

00:08:31.730 --> 00:08:33.790
Thank you. They're perfect.

00:08:36.100 --> 00:08:38.780
Our goal for the elimination of all our enemies is under four hours.

00:08:40.250 --> 00:08:42.440
How do we find them?

00:08:42.440 --> 00:08:45.590
I know where they're located.

00:08:45.590 --> 00:08:47.080
You do?

00:08:47.080 --> 00:08:49.160
I did some research ahead of time.

00:08:49.160 --> 00:08:52.330
All we have to do is wait there and ambush them.

00:08:52.330 --> 00:08:54.710
Isn't that a little cutthroat?

00:08:54.710 --> 00:08:59.030
Looking up info on the enemy is certainly not cheating, to me.

00:08:59.030 --> 00:09:02.850
How about looking up people's pasts and using that as blackmail?

00:09:02.850 --> 00:09:03.990
What do you mean?

00:09:03.990 --> 00:09:05.660
Oh, nothing.

00:09:06.360 --> 00:09:11.290
Don't worry guys. Just stick with Sion for an easy win.

00:09:11.290 --> 00:09:13.580
In war, information is everything.

00:09:13.580 --> 00:09:16.500
Using information advantageously is another way to victory.

00:09:17.720 --> 00:09:19.210
What victory?

00:09:19.990 --> 00:09:20.720
Bingo.

00:09:22.790 --> 00:09:26.040
Great, they don't seem to have noticed us at all.

00:09:26.040 --> 00:09:28.020
But it could be a trap.

00:09:28.020 --> 00:09:30.100
What's the plan, Sion?

00:09:30.100 --> 00:09:33.100
Let's do it. Smash them in one shot!

00:09:33.100 --> 00:09:33.600
Let's go.

00:09:33.730 --> 00:09:34.430
Right!

00:09:36.420 --> 00:09:37.730
Here goes, Ryner.

00:09:45.670 --> 00:09:48.150
What I seek is thunder. Izuchi!

00:09:53.640 --> 00:09:56.580
A toast to our first victory!

00:09:57.520 --> 00:10:00.090
It went just as Sion planned!

00:10:00.090 --> 00:10:03.540
See? Believe in Lord Sion!

00:10:03.540 --> 00:10:06.170
I was so surprised the enemy was there!

00:10:06.170 --> 00:10:08.450
They're the ones who were surprised!

00:10:08.450 --> 00:10:11.680
Did you see the looks on their faces?

00:10:11.680 --> 00:10:14.930
I'm with Sion for life!

00:10:29.700 --> 00:10:33.730
Mind if I asked why you joined this academy?

00:10:34.320 --> 00:10:37.430
You've already looked it up, right?

00:10:37.430 --> 00:10:38.540
You got me.

00:10:39.370 --> 00:10:43.550
Roland Special Institute #307. The orphanage you grew up in.

00:10:45.260 --> 00:10:50.050
On paper, an institution meant to raise children orphaned by war.

00:10:50.410 --> 00:10:55.710
But behind the scenes they were really gathering children and putting them through harsh military training.

00:10:55.710 --> 00:11:00.580
The talentless were disposed of. Those who survived were sold to nobles...

00:11:00.580 --> 00:11:02.530
or thrown onto the front lines.

00:11:02.530 --> 00:11:08.300
But suddenly, the war ended. With no war, the institute lost its purpose.

00:11:08.300 --> 00:11:12.530
The orphans there were faced with a tough choice.

00:11:12.530 --> 00:11:18.360
Remain under military command... or be silenced through murder.

00:11:18.360 --> 00:11:23.380
You chose the former, and entered the Royal Special Military Academy.

00:11:23.380 --> 00:11:24.860
Say, Ryner.

00:11:24.860 --> 00:11:25.630
What?

00:11:26.280 --> 00:11:31.050
Don't you want revenge against this country?

00:11:32.060 --> 00:11:33.430
Revenge?

00:11:33.430 --> 00:11:38.580
Haven't you ever wanted to crush this corrupt land?

00:11:38.580 --> 00:11:42.450
This land that shuns you as taboo just for your Alpha Stigma.

00:11:42.450 --> 00:11:46.020
This foolish kingdom that oppresses the weak and fights ceaselessly.

00:11:46.020 --> 00:11:48.550
The nobles caught in that never-ending cycle…

00:11:48.550 --> 00:11:52.010
You could be executed for saying that.

00:11:52.010 --> 00:11:57.820
Maybe. But you hate this country. You wouldn't turn me in.

00:11:57.820 --> 00:11:59.940
It's far too much effort to bother.

00:11:59.940 --> 00:12:02.940
I know that's not your true reason.

00:12:02.940 --> 00:12:05.150
Don't decide that for yourself.

00:12:05.150 --> 00:12:07.880
I'll do it, Ryner.

00:12:08.570 --> 00:12:12.140
I'll become the king of this land and change everything.

00:12:12.520 --> 00:12:15.680
I'll make the world you once desired.

00:12:15.940 --> 00:12:17.450
So, Ryner...

00:12:17.450 --> 00:12:18.570
Join me.

00:12:28.760 --> 00:12:31.020
Sorry, I'll pass.

00:12:31.020 --> 00:12:34.290
But if you do become king, could you make a law

00:12:34.290 --> 00:12:39.040
that gives promotions to people who take lots of afternoon naps?

00:12:42.270 --> 00:12:46.680
You're funny. Maybe that's why I want you.

00:12:46.680 --> 00:12:49.710
Nothing to do with the Alpha Stigma.

00:12:50.920 --> 00:12:52.090
Run, Ryner!

00:12:52.090 --> 00:12:53.090
What's this?

00:12:53.090 --> 00:12:54.650
They're just after me.

00:12:54.650 --> 00:12:56.040
Oh, is that right?

00:12:56.810 --> 00:12:57.810
Okay, have fun with that!

00:12:57.810 --> 00:12:59.680
Hey, show a little concern!

00:13:01.500 --> 00:13:06.130
Sion! If you want to be king, don't die from something that weak!

00:13:06.130 --> 00:13:07.480
Something this weak?

00:13:07.480 --> 00:13:09.030
Well, I guess you've got a point.

00:13:37.980 --> 00:13:40.800
<i>I won't die from something that weak.</i>

00:13:42.340 --> 00:13:45.960
<i>I'll become king. I can't die here.</i>

00:13:45.960 --> 00:13:48.390
What I seek is the destructive rainbow. Kuuri!

00:13:55.810 --> 00:13:56.780
Dumplings?

00:13:56.780 --> 00:13:58.900
Will you continue this misconduct?

00:13:58.900 --> 00:14:02.250
I will not permit criminal actions in this area.

00:14:02.250 --> 00:14:04.780
That's the task my brother gave me...

00:14:09.100 --> 00:14:11.870
Then you'll continue? In that case, I'll kill you.

00:14:11.870 --> 00:14:12.870
Mockery!

00:14:12.870 --> 00:14:14.250
Making a fool of us!

00:14:19.240 --> 00:14:21.270
What I seek is thunder. Izuchi!

00:14:37.940 --> 00:14:41.640
They say that when dogs receive a favor, they remember it all their life.

00:14:41.640 --> 00:14:42.680
A dog?

00:14:42.680 --> 00:14:45.890
A rescued dog should remember his debt,

00:14:45.890 --> 00:14:50.410
and buy a recommended combo set #4 from the Wynnit dumpling shop

00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:52.540
to drop off at my house.

00:14:53.710 --> 00:14:57.440
Here you go! It's for that lovely lady, right?

00:14:57.440 --> 00:15:00.280
The Eris family residence is just up ahead.

00:15:02.520 --> 00:15:08.930
<i>To think she belonged to the Eris family. Why would the distinguished sword clan</i>

00:15:08.930 --> 00:15:11.670
<i>charged with guarding the Roland royal family rescue me?</i>

00:15:12.840 --> 00:15:15.680
Sir Sion Astal has arrived.

00:15:16.360 --> 00:15:19.680
No need for it today. I've left this to Ferris.

00:15:20.720 --> 00:15:25.480
My brother told me to help you out for a while.

00:15:25.480 --> 00:15:27.760
Ah. Why?

00:15:28.320 --> 00:15:33.980
My brother's orders are absolute. Why are you being targeted?

00:15:33.980 --> 00:15:35.810
Oh, that?

00:15:37.900 --> 00:15:41.270
It could take some time to explain. You don't mind?

00:15:41.930 --> 00:15:48.910
My mother was a commoner, and my father is a famous nobleman. You see?

00:15:48.910 --> 00:15:51.580
Mine was an unwanted birth.

00:15:51.580 --> 00:15:54.890
I was separated from my father when I was very young.

00:15:56.180 --> 00:15:59.720
My mother raised me with love.

00:16:00.410 --> 00:16:05.320
Because I endured their relentless bullying, and because my mother died,

00:16:05.320 --> 00:16:07.990
the hatred towards me has kept growing worse.

00:16:09.460 --> 00:16:15.460
From what I've heard, it seems that my half-brothers hate me.

00:16:16.720 --> 00:16:21.000
It was probably one of them trying to kill me.

00:16:21.870 --> 00:16:23.320
I see.

00:16:23.320 --> 00:16:25.650
I want to know who it is.

00:16:25.650 --> 00:16:30.700
Even just to know where he is. May I ask that of you?

00:16:30.700 --> 00:16:34.550
I'll try. Otherwise, my brother will kill me.

00:16:35.630 --> 00:16:37.360
I'll hire a henchman.

00:16:37.360 --> 00:16:39.170
That sounds good.

00:16:39.170 --> 00:16:40.230
Then...

00:16:41.260 --> 00:16:45.240
...starting tomorrow, two recommended dumpling sets for me and my henchman.

00:16:45.240 --> 00:16:46.820
Sure...

00:16:47.690 --> 00:16:50.190
Can I not meet with your brother?

00:16:50.190 --> 00:16:53.910
Not now. When he wants to meet you he'll come to you.

00:16:55.300 --> 00:16:56.730
Who's that?

00:16:56.730 --> 00:16:59.660
A new delivery boy from the Wynnit dumpling shop.

00:16:59.660 --> 00:17:03.340
Iris, rejoice. Starting tomorrow you'll be my henchman.

00:17:04.220 --> 00:17:06.260
All right! Iris will do her best!

00:17:06.260 --> 00:17:10.890
Iris will work hard and be useful to her dear sister!

00:17:10.890 --> 00:17:13.900
It's afternoon already. How long will you sleep?

00:17:13.900 --> 00:17:16.030
As long as I can.

00:17:16.030 --> 00:17:18.060
Here, have some lunch.

00:17:18.060 --> 00:17:20.630
Getting lunch from Kiefer!?

00:17:20.630 --> 00:17:22.130
What's with that reaction!?

00:17:22.130 --> 00:17:24.260
Rot in hell!

00:17:25.120 --> 00:17:27.970
Say, is Sion taking today off, too?

00:17:29.180 --> 00:17:31.670
Then what comes next?

00:17:31.670 --> 00:17:34.380
We can make direct contact with the mastermind.

00:17:34.380 --> 00:17:36.000
But I noticed something.

00:17:36.000 --> 00:17:37.020
Yes?

00:17:37.020 --> 00:17:39.570
It's frantic in the castle.

00:17:39.570 --> 00:17:42.460
In the past few days, its comings and goings have gotten hectic.

00:17:42.460 --> 00:17:43.620
I see.

00:17:43.620 --> 00:17:46.710
It makes covert action easier, though.

00:17:47.380 --> 00:17:50.220
I hope to hear a good report soon.

00:17:55.290 --> 00:17:56.680
Sir Sion!

00:17:56.680 --> 00:17:59.070
What's got you so uneasy?

00:17:59.070 --> 00:18:02.850
What do we do? We could die!

00:18:03.930 --> 00:18:05.110
Quiet.

00:18:07.040 --> 00:18:08.690
It's all over!

00:18:08.690 --> 00:18:10.280
Fill me in, Roll.

00:18:10.580 --> 00:18:16.000
I hear the kingdom of Estabul has invaded our territory!

00:18:16.000 --> 00:18:18.710
War is starting again!

00:18:18.710 --> 00:18:19.410
No way...

00:18:24.330 --> 00:18:28.750
This year, Estabul had a long rainy season, and their main river flooded over.

00:18:28.750 --> 00:18:32.310
They're facing an unprecedented food shortage.

00:18:32.310 --> 00:18:36.180
Estabul is trying to overcome its food crisis

00:18:36.180 --> 00:18:39.110
by hiring more soldiers and invading neighboring lands.

00:18:39.110 --> 00:18:42.940
War... War is starting again.

00:18:43.520 --> 00:18:47.660
<i>A war with no end in sight... Those incompetent kings!</i>

00:18:47.660 --> 00:18:52.000
<i>Can they do nothing other then harm their kingdoms and destroy things?</i>

00:18:52.740 --> 00:18:55.050
This is a dispatch order!

00:18:55.050 --> 00:19:00.000
As of this morning, all students are to advance to the front lines!

00:19:04.860 --> 00:19:09.690
So quiet... No surprise there.

00:19:09.690 --> 00:19:11.510
I'll nap until we march.

00:19:15.080 --> 00:19:17.030
You're impressive, Ryner.

00:19:18.460 --> 00:19:20.640
How can you stay so calm?

00:19:21.580 --> 00:19:24.810
People dying on the battlefield...

00:19:24.810 --> 00:19:26.150
It's terrifying.

00:19:26.940 --> 00:19:30.690
You dying scares me the most.

00:19:30.690 --> 00:19:32.410
I'm not...

00:19:32.410 --> 00:19:34.740
Ryner, get away!

00:19:34.740 --> 00:19:39.070
If you went out to battle, you'd die easily!

00:19:39.070 --> 00:19:40.990
You should run, Ryner!

00:19:41.630 --> 00:19:43.370
Get out of this academy right now!

00:19:45.580 --> 00:19:49.210
Kiefer, I won't die that easily.

00:19:49.850 --> 00:19:51.480
I've no intention of dying.

00:20:01.950 --> 00:20:05.310
Water, more water!
Please, hold on! I can't breathe like...

00:20:05.950 --> 00:20:09.240
Iris, enough water. Next are the nails.

00:20:09.240 --> 00:20:11.410
Okay, sister!

00:20:11.410 --> 00:20:12.370
Nails, nails!

00:20:12.370 --> 00:20:14.410
Wait, please, hold on!

00:20:14.410 --> 00:20:16.960
Fine, I'll talk. I'll tell you anything you want.

00:20:16.960 --> 00:20:22.560
Then I'll ask. Was it you who ordered the attack on Sion Astal, Brophs?

00:20:22.560 --> 00:20:25.480
Oh, so you're pawns of Astal?

00:20:27.380 --> 00:20:29.080
He'll be dead soon.

00:20:29.080 --> 00:20:32.770
Sion will die? What do you mean by that?

00:20:32.770 --> 00:20:34.210
It's a trap.

00:20:34.580 --> 00:20:37.320
There are fifty Estabul Magic Knights

00:20:37.320 --> 00:20:40.700
assembled on the Roxanne Plains.

00:20:41.460 --> 00:20:46.410
Everyone, relax. We won't die in this war.

00:20:46.410 --> 00:20:49.360
We've been deployed to the Roxanne Plains,

00:20:49.370 --> 00:20:52.440
a remote non-combat region.

00:20:53.240 --> 00:20:57.370
I told you, sticking with Sion is the way to go!

00:20:57.370 --> 00:20:59.610
We aren't going to die.

00:21:00.260 --> 00:21:04.820
Kiefer, relax. Our futures will continue on.

00:21:06.260 --> 00:21:12.280
Astal thinks he's going to a safe place.

00:21:12.280 --> 00:21:15.240
Fifty Magic Knights.

00:21:15.970 --> 00:21:17.470
What a clown.

00:21:17.470 --> 00:21:22.020
He thinks he can bare his fangs at the prince and win? Hilarious!

00:21:22.020 --> 00:21:26.770
There's even a spy planted amongst his friends!

00:21:27.210 --> 00:21:32.090
No dragging your feet! We're crossing this mountain before dawn!

00:21:40.040 --> 00:21:40.550
Kiefer?

00:21:43.430 --> 00:21:48.260
Move it! don't fall behind Estabul!

00:23:20.630 --> 00:23:23.830
<i>Departing for the front really sucks.</i>

00:23:23.830 --> 00:23:26.790
<i>Why can't you guys take it easy every day?</i>

00:23:26.790 --> 00:23:31.150
<i>Why fight? What's so fun about this?</i>

00:23:31.150 --> 00:23:34.760
<i>War really sucks.</i>
